OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 FEB
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GJean-Yves Thibaudet joins the
OL,6,     Geminent orchestra for Gershwin's
OL,7,     GPiano Concerto plus music by
OL,8,     GStravinsky, Ravel & Carlos Simon.
OL,9,     GJohn Shea presents.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
